<node id="УОВТ">
  <data key="d0">EQUIPMENT</data>
  <data key="d1">УОВТ, or intermediate cooling equipment, is essential in the rolling process for metals. It is specifically utilized in the accelerated cooling of metals at the 3600 mill. This equipment plays a critical role in the cooling phase, helping to enhance the physical properties of metals by controlling their temperature during processing. The УОВТ system is part of the broader cooling setup used in the process known as КПУО (күрурменің прокаттану үрдісі), ensuring that the metal achieves the desired structural characteristics after being rolled. Overall, УОВТ is a key component in advancing the efficiency and effectiveness of metal treatment in industrial applications.</data>
