<node id="UNION CARBIDE CORPORATION">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">Union Carbide Corporation is a prominent chemical company that has made significant contributions across various industrial sectors, particularly in the fields of chemistry and materials. The organization is renowned for its production of materials and technology that play a crucial role in the chemicals and materials industries. Union Carbide's research initiatives have notably impacted metallurgy, with a strong emphasis on microalloying and steel processing. This company has been cited in numerous publications, highlighting its involvement in cutting-edge metallurgical research. As a result, Union Carbide has established itself as an influential entity in the field of material engineering, showcasing its commitment to advancing technology and innovation within the industry.</data>
  <data key="d2">tanaka1981</data>
