<node id="T. HASHIMOTO">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">T. Hashimoto is an accomplished author known for his extensive research in the field of metallurgy, particularly focusing on steel properties and processing techniques. He has contributed to various academic journals, highlighting significant findings related to the characteristics of steel. His expertise extends to the study of steel phase transitions, where he investigates the different phases that steel undergoes under varying conditions. Through his scholarly work, T. Hashimoto has established a notable presence in the scientific community, particularly in the domains of steel research and metallurgical engineering.</data>
