</edge>
<edge source="MECHANICAL PROPERTIES" target="TENSILE STRENGTH">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Tensile strength is vital for understanding the mechanical properties of materials under tensile stress.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MECHANICAL PROPERTIES" target="DYNAMIC RECOVERY">
  <data key="d6">8.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Dynamic recovery processes impact mechanical properties by affecting dislocation structures during deformation.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MECHANICAL PROPERTIES" target="GRAIN SIZE">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Grain size significantly impacts the mechanical properties of a material, affecting its strength and ductility.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MECHANICAL PROPERTIES" target="SI">
